  triggerId: tut_musician_breakdown
  priority: 116
  category: 1
  revisitTitle: Stress
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  pages:
  - 'Your musician''s Stress took a hit. That bar is their fortitude, and it runs
    out: at zero, they break down and stop playing. Some action cards restore it,
    or shield it. Take care of your band: no band, no song.'
  highlightKey: musician_stress_bar
  mechanicText: 'A musician''s <link=stress>Stress</link> bar is their remaining
    fortitude; audience actions reduce it. At zero the musician <link=breakdown>breaks
    down</link>: <link=cohesion>Cohesion</link> loses one, the bar refills, the musician
    gets <link=shaken>Shaken</link>. Cohesion at zero loses the gig. Some <link=action_card>action
    cards</link> restore or protect fortitude.'
